{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRangeTop","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRangeTop","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SeminormalRange","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.SytSwapTransport","lean:module:QOU.SchurWeyl.OffDiagNonvanishing"],"declarations":3,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_range_eq_top","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.seminormalRep_range_eq_top","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalRangeTop.lean#L83-L90","doc":"**The seminormal representation is surjective onto the matrix block.**\n\n`ρ_λ : H_n(q) →ₐ[K] M_{#SYT λ}(ℝ)` hits *everything* — the irreducibility statement SW-7 consumes.\nEvery matrix unit is in the image (`single_mem_range`), and the units generate. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.single_mem_range","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.single_mem_range","kind":"theorem","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalRangeTop.lean#L66-L81","doc":"**Every matrix unit lies in the image.**  Induct along the connectivity chain: the diagonal\nunits are already there, and each admissible step composes on a new off-diagonal unit. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.SchurWeyl.single_mem_range_of_swapStep","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.SchurWeyl.single_mem_range_of_swapStep","kind":"theorem","line":44,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/SchurWeyl/SeminormalRangeTop.lean#L44-L64","doc":"**One admissible swap step promotes to an off-diagonal matrix unit.**  The generator `σ_k`\ncarries the entry `offDiag q (axialDist T k)` at `(s_k·T, T)`, which\n`offDiag_axialDist_ne_zero` makes nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0}]}